{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endless labyrinth, three levels, three floors\u2026 and no mistakes allowed.</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAD SECTOR \u00b3</strong> is a psychological horror game where every room may conceal corruptions you must detect to move forward. Make <strong>three mistakes</strong>, and you\u2019ll be thrown back to the previous floor\u2026 forced to start all over again.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through an <strong>unstable structure</strong> that <strong>reshapes itself with every attempt</strong>: rooms shift, turning the path ahead into an unpredictable maze. The mechanical irises will grant you access to the following sectors.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Three levels, each with multiple floors to overcome.<br></li><li> An architecture that resets after every trial, ensuring unique runs.<br></li><li> A progression\u2013regression system that puts your nerves to the test.<br></li><li> Three difficulty modes.<br></li><li> Automatic save system.<br></li><li> Steam leaderboards and achievements to challenge your friends.<br></li><li> Demo length: 20\u201340 minutes.<br></li><li> First full run: 2\u20133 hours.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corrupted, the structure cannot repair itself.</h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It summons you</strong>, twisting your desire to escape <strong>into a tool for its own survival.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798290?t=1759137233","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798290/9c48c40bc79b40cc884d5ab393622e2e6040ebb4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759137233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798290/2ca5ffb85ab24fbc3c076c51ecd464a05fbdd8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759137233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798290/2ca5ffb85ab24fbc3c076c